            "contentType": "STORY",
            "title": "Polar Power, ZQuip collaborate to develop DC hybrid power systems",
            "description": "",
            "summary": "Polar Power (POLA) announced a collaboration with ZQuip to develop and supply DC hybrid power systems tailored for construction equipment. Over the past year, Polar Power and ZQuip have jointly designed a compact diesel-fueled charging system aimed at electric construction vehicles. This solution addresses the need to reduce emissions, noise, and operational costs at both urban and remote construction sites. This modular DC charger serves as a range extender when installed on mobile off-highway",
